---
const faqs = [
  {
    q: "How much does custom software development cost in NYC?",
    a: "Custom software cost depends on scope, integrations, and timeline. Most NYC projects are priced in milestones so discovery, build, and optimization are clear and measurable.",
  },
  {
    q: "What does a web development project cost in NYC?",
    a: "Web development budgets vary by page count, CMS needs, and conversion requirements. Most teams start with a focused phase and then expand with SEO and growth sprints.",
  },
  {
    q: "How much does app development cost in NYC?",
    a: "App development pricing changes based on platform, feature depth, authentication, and API integrations. MVP builds are usually scoped first to reduce launch risk.",
  },
  {
    q: "How much does business automation cost in NYC?",
    a: "Automation projects are typically priced by system complexity and number of workflows. CRM automation and API integrations are often delivered in phased rollouts for faster ROI.",
  },
];
---

<section class="border-t border-black/5 bg-paper">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6 py-16 md:py-20">
    <h2 class="text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-slateink md:text-4xl">
      NYC Software Cost FAQs
    </h2>
    <p class="mt-3 max-w-3xl text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink/70 sm:text-base">
      Answers to common questions from businesses looking for custom software development in NYC and Brooklyn.
    </p>

    <div class="mt-10 grid gap-4">
      {faqs.map((faq) => (
        <details class="rounded-2xl border border-black/10 bg-white p-5 shadow-soft">
          <summary class="cursor-pointer list-none text-base font-semibold text-slateink">
            {faq.q}
          </summary>
          <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink/70 sm:text-base">{faq.a}</p>
        </details>
      ))}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
